## MilestoneAgent Output

Based on the scene design and common-sense feedback, here are the milestone rules for all four tasks. I'm using the relative coordinates from the scene commands (player spawns at origin, TNT at ~5,0,3, coral at ~6,0,3-4, jack_o_lantern at ~-4,0,3).

```json
